cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the WoMI-Bench protocol, cite this release and the upstream benchmarks used in your study."
title: "WoMI-Bench: World Model Index Benchmark"
authors:
  - name: "Score Technologies"
    website: "https://github.com/score-technologies"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
url: "https://github.com/mxmsbt/WoMI-Bench"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxmsbt/WoMI-Bench"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open evaluation framework for world generation, reconstruction,
  persistence, editing and dynamics. This protocol release specifies
  matched comparisons, prospective prediction before outcome revelation,
  independent evidence replay and capability-level reporting.
keywords:
  - world models
  - spatial intelligence
  - evaluation
  - benchmark
  - computer vision
  - reproducibility
